    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To implement the file `moderate_text.py` that scores user text for unsafe or policy-violating content, I will use the Amazon Comprehend service, which is a natural language processing (NLP) service that uses machine learning to find insights and relationships in text. Amazon Comprehend can detect entities, key phrases, languages, sentiments, and other elements in a document. For the purpose of this task, I will use the Amazon Comprehend DetectToxicContent API, which identifies toxic content in text. This will make the provider identifiable in the code. </thinking>\n",
